## ─── Credentials and secrets – NEVER commit these ───────────────────────────
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
# Exceptions: example/template files that document what is needed
!*.example.pem
!*.example.key

## ─── Application configuration with real credentials ────────────────────────
# Use application-local.properties or environment variables instead
application-local.properties

